      "writtenOn": "2024-02-14T18:23:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I\u0027ve designed the module so that `aconfig_declarations_group` can depend on other `aconfig_declarations_group`. PTAL at [this topic CLs](https://googleplex-android-review.git.corp.google.com/q/topic:%22aconfig_declarations_group%22). However, thinking of it now it does not make sense for an `aconfig_declarations_group` to depend on another via the currently defined properties of the module (i.e. java, rust, cc _aconfig_libraries). I\u0027ve added another property `aconfig_declarations_groups` where the dependent modules can be specified. I\u0027ll update the aforementioned CLs accordingly as well.",
