      "writtenOn": "2024-02-14T03:31:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we consider keeping codegenInfo language agnostic? Specifically, make this new module type set a `JavaInfoProvider` which contains the srcJars information \n\nWe have several places in the tree where the provider interface between java modules is a `JavaInfoProvider` https://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dOtherModuleProvider.*JavaInfo\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main. If we use a new provider for this, we might need to update those",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 32,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "0d762f8c921db1422a615b28649a2e09efd5dc8d",
